  "old_is_exact_first_parent": true,
  "new_commit_message": "[skills] standardize EAS CLI invocations and simplify triggers (#223)\n\nConsolidate the mechanical EAS CLI invocation updates in one stack\nlayer: 125 direct substitutions across 15 existing skill, reference, and\nagent metadata files now use `npx --yes eas-cli@latest` in place of bare\n`eas` or `npx eas-cli@latest`. This extends the existing Hosting, dev\nclient, and workflow examples to app stores, Update, Update Insights,\nObserve, and App Clip. Remove global EAS CLI installation instructions\nfrom the app-store quick start and Update Insights prerequisites; check\nthe current account before browser sign-in. The layer also simplifies\nskill triggers and keeps development client signing and distribution\ntied to the requested project and build.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `bun test scripts` — 37 passed on the integrated #224 branch.\n- `bun scripts/check-skill-limits.ts`, `bun\nscripts/check-overview-routing.ts`, and `bun\nscripts/check-plugin-version-bump.ts origin/main` — passed.\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` — passed.\n- Confirmed PR #223 contains no global EAS CLI install instruction.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kudo Chien <kudo@KudodeMacBook-Pro.local>",
